{"t":"Spike Sword Quest","s":"spike-sword-quest-fe006","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_01_08a4e5.jpg","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Spike Sword Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fire Devil Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A warrior journeyed too far into the earth\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>A few steps north east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Triangle%20Tower\">Triangle Tower</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Spike%20Sword\">Spike Sword</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> spell or <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a> for <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Go to the small cave east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32593,32068,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32593, 32068, 7)</a>), and go down.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>You will be in a small room, go down another level:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword Quest Map 01\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"65\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_01_08a4e5.jpg\" width=\"66\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>In this room, you will need to pick a hole just to the south-west, as indicated on the map. Go down the hole:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword Quest Map 02\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"63\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_02_0e6f9d.jpg\" width=\"88\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>In this room is one <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a>. Follow the passage around to the west, and go down another level. You may want to use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> spell or <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> now:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword Quest Map 03\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"81\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_03_976c11.jpg\" width=\"99\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>On this level, there will be 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>. Head to the south-west corner of the room, and pick another hole, then go down:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword Quest Map 04\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_04_45b021.jpg\" width=\"126\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Now you will be surrounded by lava, and there will be a large number of <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>, 4 of them are reachable, 10 of them are on islands, but they can still reach you with their Fireball attacks. It is recommended for someone to go <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> and clear this room. The reward is inside a body that is hidden behind a pillar.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword Quest Map 05\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_Quest_Map_05_40834e.jpg\" width=\"157\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Note: You will likely hear the roar of three <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>. These dragons are caged at the far north end of the room. It is unknown how or why they are there.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}